# Token map
- Color: canvas #FFFFFF; surface #F5F7FA; text #26364A; muted #667386; border #D9DFE7; accent #2F6FED; critical #B42318; success #197A55.
- Type: display 28/36; heading 20/28; body 16/24; caption 13/18; system sans.
- Space: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48.
- Shape: radius 4; control radius 6; focus ring 2px accent with 2px offset.
- Motion: 150ms standard; 250ms emphasis; reduced-motion equivalent required.
- Layout: 8px grid; 1200px content maximum; 44px minimum control size.

Rationale: Semantic tokens improve consistency, substitution, maintenance, and visual validation.
Quality gates: WCAG AA contrast; semantic names; no unexplained one-off values; light, zoom, and high-contrast checks.